[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    335[0m:[38;5;10m[49m             );
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    336[0m:[38;5;10m[49m         }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    337[0m:[38;5;10m[49m         // create_block's `flags` is a uint8_t with no valid-variant set: every
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    338[0m:[38;5;10m[49m         // one of the 256 values is legal and must behave identically. This is the
